Then, by AM-GM inequality, we have
\begin{align*}
 \sqrt{a}+\sqrt{b}+\sqrt{c}+\frac{1}{\sqrt{abc}} &= \sqrt{a}+\sqrt{b}+\sqrt{c}+\frac{1}{9\sqrt{abc}}\cdot 9 
&= \sqrt{a}+\sqrt{b}+\sqrt{c}+\frac{1}{9\sqrt{abc}} +\frac{1}{9\sqrt{abc}} + \cdots + \frac{1}{9\sqrt{abc}} 
&\geq 12\cdot \sqrt[12]{\sqrt{a}\cdot\sqrt{b}\cdot\sqrt{c}\cdot \bigg(\frac{1}{9\sqrt{abc}}\bigg)^9}= 12\cdot \sqrt[12]{\frac{1}{9^9\cdot (abc)^4} }
&\geq 12\cdot \sqrt[12]{\frac{3^{12}}{9^9}}=12\cdot \sqrt[12]{\frac{3^{12}}{3^{18}}}= 12\cdot\Big(\frac{1}{3^6}\Big)^{1/12}=12\cdot \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}}=4\sqrt{3}
\end{align*}
with equality iff  $a=b=c=\frac{1}{3}$ .

